sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Pengguna
    participant FE as Frontend (Wizard / Generator)
    participant API as Backend (/api/generate-prd)
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL
    participant AI as Google Gemini API

    User->>FE: Input Ide & Klik Lanjut
    FE->>API: POST /api/generate-clarifications { userIdea }
    API->>AI: Model Flash Generate Questions with Badges
    AI-->>API: JSON Clarification Questions
    API-->>FE: HTTP 200 Opsi Pertanyaan & Rekomendasi
    FE-->>User: Tampilkan Chip Pilihan + Auto-Select

    User->>FE: Pilih Konfigurasi & Klik Buat PRD
    FE->>API: POST /api/generate-prd { idea, answers, templateId }
    API->>DB: Query profiles (Cek Kuota & Tier)
    DB-->>API: Data Profil & Kuota Tersedia

    API->>AI: generateContent (Model Ladder: gemini-3.8 / 3.5 / Flash)
    Note over API,AI: Payload Structured Schema (8 Diagram & Contracts)
    AI-->>API: Full PRD Structured Output JSON

    API->>DB: INSERT into prd_history (Record Audit & Token)
    API->>DB: UPDATE profiles (Increment trial_count)
    API-->>FE: HTTP 200 PRD JSON Data
    FE-->>User: Render Dokumen PRD, Pohon Fitur & 8 Diagram
